      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Necrotic damage, and the target's Strength score decreases by 1d4. The target dies if this reduces that score to 0. If a Humanoid is slain by this attack, a <strong>Shadow</strong> rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qqwbOYJqDuTP2N5e\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature also provides an <strong>Active Effect (AE)</strong> to modify the target's <strong>Strength Score</strong>. When the target roll's their d4 to determine the loss, you can apply the respective AE to the target's sheet.</p></section>",
